# Baseline

`AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the engineering baseline. Read it before editing and follow it for the whole session.

- One folder per product: ParkPe `apps/parkpe/` (:4310), PaySwap `apps/payswap/` (:4500), API `apps/backend/` (auth :4600, Django :4610). Shared code is `packages/contracts`, `packages/sdk-client`, `packages/ui-tokens`. Do not copy one app into the other.
- Edit only the files the task needs. Leave unrelated modules and working behavior alone.
- Write in the voice already in the tree: short comments that name the other file, route, or role. No filler and no banner comments.
- Shared names live in `apps/backend/auth/contract.py`. Auth checks live in `apps/backend/auth/server.py`, not in the browser.
- After an edit, check the callers that comment points at, run the check `AGENTS.md` names for that area, and say what you ran and what you skipped.

A narrower rule in `.cursor/rules/` adds detail for its own files. It does not relax this baseline.
